###  http://www.semanticarts.com/vocab/_Concept_Cyc
<http://www.semanticarts.com/vocab/_Concept_Cyc> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                          skos:Concept ;
                                                 skos:definition "An ontology built by Cycorp to support common sense reasoning. " ,
                                                                 "From encyclopedia, a project to capture and express the axioms needed for a machine to reason equivalently to a human." ;
                                                 skos:inScheme <http://www.semanticarts.com/vocab/_Domain_ontology> ;
                                                 skos:prefLabel "Cyc" .


